### What would you like to be added?

File in question: https://github.com/kubernetes/client-go/blob/45e0decafa9b847c983f55c84b4f6ce5617f8f69/util/workqueue/metrics.go

@kubernetes/sig-api-machinery
@kubernetes/sig-instrumentation

### Why is this needed?

As a k8s infrastructure provider, we'd like to expose those metrics, but in order to do so, we'd like more reassurance that they won't change.
